{"doc_id": "csrc_0050_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0050_att1::c0054", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "（四）其他违反法律、行政法规和中国证监会规定转让股份\n的情形。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
